    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired from short sleep; appetite normal</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations since the collapse</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache, weakness or numbness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Persecutory beliefs persist; no hallucinations; no thoughts of suicide or of harming anyone</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

